laceholder":958},[928,1376,1378],{"class":930,"line":1377},25,[928,1379,1380],{"class":1009},"\u002F\u002F Receipts — hosted invoice URLs, no PDF plumbing\n",[928,1382,1384,1387,1389,1391,1393,1396,1399,1401,1404,1406],{"class":930,"line":1383},26,[928,1385,1386],{"class":1094},"foreach",[928,1388,1142],{"class":942},[928,1390,1027],{"class":938},[928,1392,1030],{"class":942},[928,1394,1395],{"class":938},"orders ",[928,1397,1398],{"class":942},"as",[928,1400,1024],{"class":942},[928,1402,1403],{"class":938},"order",[928,1405,713],{"class":942},[928,1407,1155],{"class":942},[928,1409,1411,1414,1416,1418,1420,1423],{"class":930,"line":1410},27,[928,1412,1413],{"class":1033},"    echo",[928,1415,1024],{"class":942},[928,1417,1403],{"class":938},[928,1419,1030],{"class":942},[928,1421,1422],{"class":1033},"invoiceUrl",[928,1424,1084],{"class":942},[928,1426,1428],{"class":930,"line":1427},28,[928,1429,999],{"class":942},[497,1431,1432,1433,1435,1436,1438],{},"No VAT logic, no tax tables, no invoice templates, no client-side checkout widget to embed —\nthe checkout is a server-side redirect, like Stripe Checkout. See ",[535,1434,92],{"href":253},"\nand ",[535,1437,84],{"href":250}," for the full surface.",[564,1440],{},[567,1442,1444],{"id":1443},"feature-parity-and-whats-still-on-the-roadmap","Feature parity, and what's still on the roadmap",[497,1446,1447],{},"Vatly covers what a SaaS needs to start selling: subscriptions with trials, plan swaps,\ncancellation with grace and resume, one-off purchases, hosted checkout, refunds and chargebacks,\nand — because it's a Merchant of Record — VAT, invoicing and tax compliance handled for you. A\nfew capabilities you may use elsewhere aren't in the box yet. Here's the honest picture, and how\nto bridge it.",[572,1449,1450,1463],{},[575,1451,1452],{},[578,1453,1454,1457,1460],{},[581,1455,1456],{},"Capability",[581,1458,1459],{},"Vatly today",[581,1461,1462],{},"Notes",[598,1464,1465,1476,1488,1502,1511,1525,1541],{},[578,1466,1467,1470,1473],{},[603,1468,1469],{},"Subscriptions, trials, swap, grace, resume",[603,1471,1472],{},"✅",[603,1474,1475],{},"Full lifecycle, Cashier-shaped API",[578,1477,1478,1481,1483],{},[603,1479,1480],{},"One-off \u002F multi-item checkout",[603,1482,1472],{},[603,1484,1485],{},[501,1486,1487],{},"checkout()->create(items: …)",[578,1489,1490,1493,1495],{},[603,1491,1492],{},"VAT, invoicing, tax remittance",[603,1494,1472],{},[603,1496,1497,1498,1501],{},"Handled — it's the point of a MoR. With Cashier (classic Stripe Billing) this is ",[514,1499,1500],{},"your"," job.",[578,1503,1504,1506,1508],{},[603,1505,845],{},[603,1507,1472],{},[603,1509,1510],{},"First-class models + events (more than most provide)",[578,1512,1513,1516,1518],{},[603,1514,1515],{},"Test \u002F live segregation",[603,1517,1472],{},[603,1519,1520,1521,1524],{},"Every record carries ",[501,1522,1523],{},"testmode","; key prefix selects the mode",[578,1526,1527,1531,1534],{},[603,1528,1529],{},[519,1530,812],{},[603,1532,1533],{},"🔜 Roadmap",[603,1535,1536,1537,1540],{},"Until native codes land, model a promo as a dedicated ",[501,1538,1539],{},"subscription_plan_…"," at the discounted price and point that cohort at it. A couple of extra plans in the dashboard — not a blocker for launching offers.",[578,1542,1543,1547,1549],{},[603,1544,1545],{},[519,1546,829],{},[603,1548,1533],{},[603,1550,1551,1552,1554,1555,1558],{},"Vatly is built for SaaS, where entitlement follows subscription state — ",[501,1553,507],{}," ",[514,1556,1557],{},"is"," your license check. Per-seat keys for downloadable\u002Foffline software (Lemon Squeezy's signature feature) aren't here yet. If you ship license-activated desktop binaries, that's the one workflow to keep elsewhere for now.",[497,1560,1561],{},"The shape of the trade is deliberate: Vatly does the compliance-heavy core that's genuinely\nhard to build — being the seller of record, VAT across the EU, invoicing, disputes — and is\nfilling in the conveniences (coupons next) in the open. For a subscription SaaS selling into\nEurope and the world, there's enough here to launch today.",[564,1563],{},[567,1565,1567],{"id":1566},"why-teams-choose-vatly","Why teams choose Vatly",[497,1569,1570,1571,1574],{},"A Merchant of Record makes the tax burden disappear — it becomes the legal seller, so VAT,\ninvoicing and remittance stop being your problem. The real question is ",[514,1572,1573],{},"whose"," entity you hand that\nto, and that's where Vatly stands apart:",[1576,1577,1578,1584,1590],"ul",{},[881,1579,1580,1583],{},[519,1581,1582],{},"Europe-first, by design."," EEA-based, EU jurisdiction, customer data kept in Europe. The other\nMoRs sit in the UK (Paddle) or the US (Lemon Squeezy, Stripe Managed Payments) — jurisdiction is\nthe one axis that genuinely separates them, and the reason Vatly exists.",[881,1585,1586,1589],{},[519,1587,1588],{},"No exposure to US policy."," Your seller-of-record relationship and your customers' data stay\nunder EU law — a clean answer when an enterprise buyer, or your own board, asks where they sit.",[881,1591,1592,1595],{},[519,1593,1594],{},"One familiar API."," The Cashier-shaped surface means there's little to learn and little to\nrewrite.",[1597,1598,1599],"blockquote",{},[497,1600,1601],{},[519,1602,1603],{},"You Just Ship.",[564,1605],{},[567,1607,1609],{"id":1608},"next-steps","Next steps",[1576,1611,1612,1620,1628],{},[881,1613,1614,1554,1617,1619],{},[519,1615,1616],{},"Starting fresh:",[535,1618,133],{"href":241}," wires up the trait, config, migrations and\nwebhook in a few minutes.",[881,1621,1622,1554,1625,1627],{},[519,1623,1624],{},"Already running another provider:",[535,1626,266],{"href":267},"\nshows how to add Vatly beside your current biller and migrate customers over gradually.",[881,1629,1630,1554,1633,1635,1636,1635,1638,1635,1640,1635,1642,1635,1644],{},[519,1631,1632],{},"Reference:",[535,1634,198],{"href":244}," · ",[535,1637,72],{"href":247},[535,1639,84],{"href":2